    {
      "v": 5,
      "zh": "买他们的宰了他们，以自己为无罪；卖他们的说：『耶和华是应当称颂的，因我成为富足。』牧养他们的并不怜恤他们。",
      "en": "Those who buy them[NOTE:1] slaughter them and are not held guilty; those who sell them say, ‘Blessed be the Lord, for I am rich.’ Their own shepherds have no compassion for them.",
      "notes": [
